      "_case2": "on earth. An adapter that returns anything but 1.23 here is pricing tokens itself,",
      "_case3": "which ADR-v2-001 forbids. This is what makes 'no re-pricing' observable.",
      "at": "2026-08-20T10:00:00.000Z",
